<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">自修教室管理：盛婷婷<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">（</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">自修教室：教学楼</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Batang','serif'; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">Ⅰ</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">号楼<SPAN lang=EN-US> 1314 </SPAN>教室）<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">路口管理老师：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 49pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 3.5; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">路口<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>：</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">群贤中路与绿云路红绿灯交叉点</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN>王玉宇<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>王海燕<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 49pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 3.5; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">路口<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>：解放路与梅南路红绿灯路口左转<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN>金建忠<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>徐冲越<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>何凯</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">说明：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>1. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">各班随队老师由班主任安排具体任务；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>2. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">请各路口管理老师按照要求提前<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分钟左右到达指定地点，引导学生顺利通过。</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">三、纪律要求及注意事项<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。参加和不参加的学生都要填写好“申请书”（“申请书”由班主任保存）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">在步行过程中</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">，各班务必保持两路纵队，女生在前、男生在后。学生</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">必须严守纪律，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">不得相互超越，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">不得追逐打闹，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">不得私自离队，不得带手机，中途不得停留，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">严禁沿途丢扔垃圾。要做到一切行动听指挥，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">严格遵守集合时间。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">自备矿泉水。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">在景区自由活动时，注意安全，按时到达集合地点，整队步行返校。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>5. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">每位学生穿校服，佩戴徽章，准备好运动鞋。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>6. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">途中师生因身体原因不能坚持行走的，经班主任同意可由随队校车实施救护。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>7. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">整个活动的组织情况由德育处负责评价，评价结果作为大型活动组织奖的考核依据。</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>8.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">请假的学生务必在教室自修，请假名单请班主任提前交给年段长，不得提前离校。</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">9.走读生晚自习照常。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 127pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 9.07; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=right><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">         </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">           </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">德育处<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 127pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 9.07; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=right><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                      </SPAN>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
    
